def test_full_human_message_as_the_golden_contract():
    assert rendered_message == "Rendered output should preserve the complete diagnostic explanation and its surrounding human language exactly, including the board context, the likely cause, the recommended review actions, manufacturing caveats, and all closing instructions. This paragraph describes behavior for a person instead of a stable machine-readable contract. Requiring every word, space, and punctuation mark to remain unchanged makes the test brittle when wording is improved while functional behavior stays the same. The test should instead verify a stable finding code, structured fields, or a short invariant that represents the observable contract without pinning the entire paragraph."
